<li><p class='igt' id='i168'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/169.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i168w'><span class="word" id="i168w0">Axaxiɬdik</span><span class="word" id="i168w1">tixgedr</span><span class="word" id="i168w2">ngilanh</span><span class="word" id="i168w3">ts'in',</span><span class="word" id="i168w4">ngidigg</span><span class="word" id="i168w5">xiyeghiduquyh</span><span class="word" id="i168w6">xiɬdi</span><span class="word" id="i168w7">yotithits'ok</span><span class="word" id="i168w8">hingo,</span><span class="word" id="i168w9">eyggiy</span><span class="word" id="i168w10">iy</span><span class="word" id="i168w11">nevay</span><span class="word" id="i168w12">ngilanh</span><span class="word" id="i168w13">ts'in',</span><span class="word" id="i168w14">deg</span><span class="word" id="i168w15">dodixi</span><span class="word" id="i168w16">idedig.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i168g'><span class="gloss" id="i168g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i168g1">mink</span><span class="gloss" id="i168g2">he is</span><span class="gloss" id="i168g3"></span><span class="gloss" id="i168g4">up</span><span class="gloss" id="i168g5">he ran in</span><span class="gloss" id="i168g6">now</span><span class="gloss" id="i168g7">it was rising</span><span class="gloss" id="i168g8">while</span><span class="gloss" id="i168g9">that</span><span class="gloss" id="i168g10">it</span><span class="gloss" id="i168g11">ermine</span><span class="gloss" id="i168g12">he is</span><span class="gloss" id="i168g13"></span><span class="gloss" id="i168g14">around here</span><span class="gloss" id="i168g15">up</span><span class="gloss" id="i168g16">he also</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i168ft'>'And as the bucket was starting up, the young man turned into an ermine and went up too.'<a href="#n31" class="notelink">31</a></span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i169'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/170.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i169w'><span class="word" id="i169w0">Axaxiɬdik</span><span class="word" id="i169w1">ngidixi</span><span class="word" id="i169w2">xiɬdi</span><span class="word" id="i169w3">ganhton</span><span class="word" id="i169w4">go</span><span class="word" id="i169w5">dux</span><span class="word" id="i169w6">dontr'itlts'ok.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i169g'><span class="gloss" id="i169g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i169g1">up</span><span class="gloss" id="i169g2">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i169g3">edge</span><span class="gloss" id="i169g4">here</span><span class="gloss" id="i169g5">shelf</span><span class="gloss" id="i169g6">she pulled it up to</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i169ft'>'And then the person above pulled up the rope to the ledge where she was.'</span></p></li>
