<li><p class='igt' id='i174'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/175.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i174w'><span class="word" id="i174w0">Go</span><span class="word" id="i174w1">yit</span><span class="word" id="i174w2">q'uxet'osr.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i174g'><span class="gloss" id="i174g0">here</span><span class="gloss" id="i174g1">there</span><span class="gloss" id="i174g2">they walked around</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i174ft'>'They walked around there.'</span></p></li>
