<li><p class='igt' id='i224'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/225.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i224w'><span class="word" id="i224w0">Deg</span><span class="word" id="i224w1">dodixts'in</span><span class="word" id="i224w2">xizronchenh</span><span class="word" id="i224w3">xitr'ixeneg ts'in'</span><span class="word" id="i224w4">ghiluq,</span><span class="word" id="i224w5">eygginh</span><span class="word" id="i224w6">vichidl</span><span class="word" id="i224w7">soghluq.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i224g'><span class="gloss" id="i224g0">here</span><span class="gloss" id="i224g1">from above</span><span class="gloss" id="i224g2">surely</span><span class="gloss" id="i224g3">carefully</span><span class="gloss" id="i224g4"></span><span class="gloss" id="i224g5">that</span><span class="gloss" id="i224g6">his younger brother</span><span class="gloss" id="i224g7">dear</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i224ft'>'The younger brother (was) carefully (climbing) down the cliff.'<a href="#n46" class="notelink">46</a></span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i225'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/226.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i225w'><span class="word" id="i225w0">Axaxiɬdik</span><span class="word" id="i225w1">ngitthe</span><span class="word" id="i225w2">xiɬdi</span><span class="word" id="i225w3">xeɬedz</span><span class="word" id="i225w4">dighet'a'di</span><span class="word" id="i225w5">non'idiyo.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i225g'><span class="gloss" id="i225g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i225g1">down to water</span><span class="gloss" id="i225g2">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i225g3">well</span><span class="gloss" id="i225g4">where it was</span><span class="gloss" id="i225g5">he went back down</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i225ft'>'And eventually he got to the water.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i226'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/227.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i226w'><span class="word" id="i226w0">&quot;He,</span><span class="word" id="i226w1">duxoghlingith ts'in'</span><span class="word" id="i226w2">dingit'anh,&quot;</span><span class="word" id="i226w3">yiɬne.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i226g'><span class="gloss" id="i226g0">oh really</span><span class="gloss" id="i226g1">how long</span><span class="gloss" id="i226g2">you're doing</span><span class="gloss" id="i226g3">he said</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i226ft'>&quot;'Why, how long you have been,&quot; said the man.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i227'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/228.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i227w'><span class="word" id="i227w0">&quot;Ngo</span><span class="word" id="i227w1">getiy</span><span class="word" id="i227w2">xuxetroth</span><span class="word" id="i227w3">doduxts'in,&quot;</span><span class="word" id="i227w4">yiɬne</span><span class="word" id="i227w5">tr'i'ne.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i227g'><span class="gloss" id="i227g0">well</span><span class="gloss" id="i227g1">very</span><span class="gloss" id="i227g2">it's hard</span><span class="gloss" id="i227g3">coming down</span><span class="gloss" id="i227g4">he said</span><span class="gloss" id="i227g5">they say</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i227ft'>&quot;'It was really hard getting down,&quot; he said.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i228'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/229.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i228w'><span class="word" id="i228w0">Ts'an ts'in'</span><span class="word" id="i228w1">axaxiɬdik</span><span class="word" id="i228w2">(v)iyed</span><span class="word" id="i228w3">yenxot'ots.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i228g'><span class="gloss" id="i228g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i228g1">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i228g2">canoe</span><span class="gloss" id="i228g3">they got back in</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i228ft'>'So then they got back in the canoe.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i229'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/230.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i229w'><span class="word" id="i229w0">Xiɬdi</span><span class="word" id="i229w1">dodo.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i229g'><span class="gloss" id="i229g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i229g1">no more</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i229ft'>'Then there was no more.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i230'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/231.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i230w'><span class="word" id="i230w0">Xitl'ogh</span><span class="word" id="i230w1">dixiditldaq</span><span class="word" id="i230w2">ts'in',</span><span class="word" id="i230w3">eyggin</span><span class="word" id="i230w4">niɬ'oqay.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i230g'><span class="gloss" id="i230g0">after this</span><span class="gloss" id="i230g1">they were quiet(?)</span><span class="gloss" id="i230g2"></span><span class="gloss" id="i230g3">that</span><span class="gloss" id="i230g4">pair</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i230ft'>'They weren't going to have any more adventures.'<a href="#n47" class="notelink">47</a></span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i231'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/232.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i231w'><span class="word" id="i231w0">Axaxiɬdik</span><span class="word" id="i231w1">xitidhiqanh.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i231g'><span class="gloss" id="i231g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i231g1">they paddled on</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i231ft'>'Then they paddled on.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i232'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/233.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i232w'><span class="word" id="i232w0">Deg</span><span class="word" id="i232w1">ngido'</span><span class="word" id="i232w2">deg</span><span class="word" id="i232w3">ngidagh</span><span class="word" id="i232w4">sre'</span><span class="word" id="i232w5">nixiniɬnek.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i232g'><span class="gloss" id="i232g0">around here</span><span class="gloss" id="i232g1">downriver</span><span class="gloss" id="i232g2">around here</span><span class="gloss" id="i232g3">where</span><span class="gloss" id="i232g4">not known</span><span class="gloss" id="i232g5">they stopped</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i232ft'>'Finally they stopped somewhere.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i233'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/234.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i233w'><span class="word" id="i233w0">Deg</span><span class="word" id="i233w1">ndagh</span><span class="word" id="i233w2">sre'</span><span class="word" id="i233w3">nixiniɬnek</span><span class="word" id="i233w4">xuyiɬ</span><span class="word" id="i233w5">yuxudz</span><span class="word" id="i233w6">viɬ dixivitathdlen'.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i233g'><span class="gloss" id="i233g0">here</span><span class="gloss" id="i233g1">where</span><span class="gloss" id="i233g2">I don't know</span><span class="gloss" id="i233g3">they stopped</span><span class="gloss" id="i233g4">and</span><span class="gloss" id="i233g5">very</span><span class="gloss" id="i233g6">they became sleepy</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i233ft'>'They stopped somewhere and became very sleepy.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i234'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/235.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i234w'><span class="word" id="i234w0">Viɬ dixivitathdlen'</span><span class="word" id="i234w1">getiy</span><span class="word" id="i234w2">tr'i'ne,</span><span class="word" id="i234w3">eygginh</span><span class="word" id="i234w4">vichidl</span><span class="word" id="i234w5">soghluq</span><span class="word" id="i234w6">yiɬ.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i234g'><span class="gloss" id="i234g0">they became sleepy</span><span class="gloss" id="i234g1">very</span><span class="gloss" id="i234g2">they say</span><span class="gloss" id="i234g3">that</span><span class="gloss" id="i234g4">his younger brother</span><span class="gloss" id="i234g5">dear</span><span class="gloss" id="i234g6">also</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i234ft'>'The younger brother got very sleepy too.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i235'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/236.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i235w'><span class="word" id="i235w0">Xidigaɬ</span><span class="word" id="i235w1">xizronchenh</span><span class="word" id="i235w2">niggi ts'in'</span><span class="word" id="i235w3">dixidiyoqdi,</span><span class="word" id="i235w4">dingit'a ixan</span><span class="word" id="i235w5">engosin</span><span class="word" id="i235w6">dixitht'an.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i235g'><span class="gloss" id="i235g0">finally</span><span class="gloss" id="i235g1">indeed</span><span class="gloss" id="i235g2">to shore</span><span class="gloss" id="i235g3">when they went</span><span class="gloss" id="i235g4">better it had been</span><span class="gloss" id="i235g5">across</span><span class="gloss" id="i235g6">they had gone</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i235ft'>'Finally they went to shore, (but) it would have been better if they had gone to the other shore.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i236'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/237.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i236w'><span class="word" id="i236w0">Deloy</span><span class="word" id="i236w1">ghotthegh</span><span class="word" id="i236w2">ɬogo</span><span class="word" id="i236w3">xiɬdi</span><span class="word" id="i236w4">nuq xineqanh.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i236g'><span class="gloss" id="i236g0">mountain</span><span class="gloss" id="i236g1">below</span><span class="gloss" id="i236g2">truly</span><span class="gloss" id="i236g3">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i236g4">they landed</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i236ft'>'They landed right below a mountain.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i237'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/238.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i237w'><span class="word" id="i237w0">Ts'an</span><span class="word" id="i237w1">etley</span><span class="word" id="i237w2">duquxidhu'ots</span><span class="word" id="i237w3">yuxudz.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i237g'><span class="gloss" id="i237g0">so</span><span class="gloss" id="i237g1">I suppose</span><span class="gloss" id="i237g2">they went up the bank</span><span class="gloss" id="i237g3">just</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i237ft'>'And then they went up the bank.'</span></p></li>
