<li><p class='igt' id='i440'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/441.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i440w'><span class="word" id="i440w0">Go</span><span class="word" id="i440w1">xiɬdik</span><span class="word" id="i440w2">vidrogg</span><span class="word" id="i440w3">xiluq'uɬ</span><span class="word" id="i440w4">xiyozr</span><span class="word" id="i440w5">yitongo</span><span class="word" id="i440w6">tr'i'ne.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i440g'><span class="gloss" id="i440g0">here</span><span class="gloss" id="i440g1">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i440g2">his breast</span><span class="gloss" id="i440g3">it's white</span><span class="gloss" id="i440g4">little</span><span class="gloss" id="i440g5">meanwhile</span><span class="gloss" id="i440g6">they say</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i440ft'>'But his breast had become white.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i441'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/442.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i441w'><span class="word" id="i441w0">&quot;Agide</span><span class="word" id="i441w1">duxu</span><span class="word" id="i441w2">yitots'in'</span><span class="word" id="i441w3">dingdiyoq</span><span class="word" id="i441w4">getiy</span><span class="word" id="i441w5">ingtth'et,&quot;</span><span class="word" id="i441w6">yiɬne</span><span class="word" id="i441w7">tr'i'ne.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i441g'><span class="gloss" id="i441g0">there</span><span class="gloss" id="i441g1">well</span><span class="gloss" id="i441g2">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i441g3">you have done</span><span class="gloss" id="i441g4">very</span><span class="gloss" id="i441g5">you're pretty</span><span class="gloss" id="i441g6">he said</span><span class="gloss" id="i441g7">they say</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i441ft'>&quot;'There now, now you look first rate,&quot; he said.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i442'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/443.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i442w'><span class="word" id="i442w0">Hingo</span><span class="word" id="i442w1">xiɬdik</span><span class="word" id="i442w2">engan</span><span class="word" id="i442w3">ngine'</span><span class="word" id="i442w4">nontithiqanh</span><span class="word" id="i442w5">gegha</span><span class="word" id="i442w6">didithinqay</span><span class="word" id="i442w7">soghluqye</span><span class="word" id="i442w8">eyggi</span><span class="word" id="i442w9">xughun'</span><span class="word" id="i442w10">idigitithitthiyh</span><span class="word" id="i442w11">ts'in'</span><span class="word" id="i442w12">teq'avon.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i442g'><span class="gloss" id="i442g0">meanwhile</span><span class="gloss" id="i442g1">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i442g2">across</span><span class="gloss" id="i442g3">upriver</span><span class="gloss" id="i442g4">he started to paddle back</span><span class="gloss" id="i442g5">the older brother</span><span class="gloss" id="i442g6">his parents</span><span class="gloss" id="i442g7">dear.pl</span><span class="gloss" id="i442g8">that</span><span class="gloss" id="i442g9">on their account </span><span class="gloss" id="i442g10">he pushed him from shore</span><span class="gloss" id="i442g11"></span><span class="gloss" id="i442g12">shore</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i442ft'>'Then he pushed his older brother's canoe off from shore towards where his parents were.'<a href="#n79" class="notelink">79</a></span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i443'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/444.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i443w'><span class="word" id="i443w0">Niɬq'idh</span><span class="word" id="i443w1">yit</span><span class="word" id="i443w2">xinxighe'o</span><span class="word" id="i443w3">dixizronchenh.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i443g'><span class="gloss" id="i443g0">side by side</span><span class="gloss" id="i443g1">there</span><span class="gloss" id="i443g2">they were sticking up</span><span class="gloss" id="i443g3">sure enough</span><span class="gloss" id="i443g4"></span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i443ft'>'Sure enough, they were sitting side by side on the shore.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i444'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/445.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i444w'><span class="word" id="i444w0">Yuxudz</span><span class="word" id="i444w1">xughun'</span><span class="word" id="i444w2">nixidiqanh</span><span class="word" id="i444w3">ts'in',</span><span class="word" id="i444w4">duqon'ithiyo.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i444g'><span class="gloss" id="i444g0">right</span><span class="gloss" id="i444g1">up to them</span><span class="gloss" id="i444g2">he paddled close</span><span class="gloss" id="i444g3"></span><span class="gloss" id="i444g4"> he went ashore</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i444ft'>'He paddled right up to them and went ashore.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i445'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/446.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i445w'><span class="word" id="i445w0">Xoqo</span><span class="word" id="i445w1">xinayh</span><span class="word" id="i445w2">tr'i'ne.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i445g'><span class="gloss" id="i445g0">to them</span><span class="gloss" id="i445g1">he's calling</span><span class="gloss" id="i445g2">they say</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i445ft'>'He called out to them, they say.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i446'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/447.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i446w'><span class="word" id="i446w0">Ngiyigg</span><span class="word" id="i446w1">xits'i</span><span class="word" id="i446w2">tr'i'ne</span><span class="word" id="i446w3">ghiluq</span><span class="word" id="i446w4">dixidiɬniyh.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i446g'><span class="gloss" id="i446g0">down</span><span class="gloss" id="i446g1">from</span><span class="gloss" id="i446g2">they say</span><span class="gloss" id="i446g3">dear</span><span class="gloss" id="i446g4">they hear noise</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i446ft'>'They heard a noise from far below.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i447'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/448.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i447w'><span class="word" id="i447w0">Xoqo</span><span class="word" id="i447w1">xinayh</span><span class="word" id="i447w2">tr'i'ne.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i447g'><span class="gloss" id="i447g0">to them</span><span class="gloss" id="i447g1">he called</span><span class="gloss" id="i447g2">they say</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i447ft'>'He called to them they say.'<a href="#n80" class="notelink">80</a></span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i448'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/449.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i448w'><span class="word" id="i448w0">&quot;Ngo</span><span class="word" id="i448w1">q'idong</span><span class="word" id="i448w2">iy</span><span class="word" id="i448w3">itr'athdlat,</span><span class="word" id="i448w4">yitots'in'</span><span class="word" id="i448w5">inagh</span><span class="word" id="i448w6">didina'idaɬdhik,&quot;</span><span class="word" id="i448w7">xaɬne.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i448g'><span class="gloss" id="i448g0">well</span><span class="gloss" id="i448g1">past</span><span class="gloss" id="i448g2">it</span><span class="gloss" id="i448g3">we became</span><span class="gloss" id="i448g4">and</span><span class="gloss" id="i448g5">should</span><span class="gloss" id="i448g6">leave us alone</span><span class="gloss" id="i448g7">they said</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i448ft'>&quot;'We have begun to be of the past, so please leave us alone,&quot; they said.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i449'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/450.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i449w'><span class="word" id="i449w0">Axaxiɬdik</span><span class="word" id="i449w1">ngidigg</span><span class="word" id="i449w2">duqon'ithiyo.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i449g'><span class="gloss" id="i449g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i449g1">up</span><span class="gloss" id="i449g2">he went up</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i449ft'>'Then he went up on shore.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i450'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/451.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i450w'><span class="word" id="i450w0">Ditso</span><span class="word" id="i450w1">q'i</span><span class="word" id="i450w2">dadhiyo.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i450g'><span class="gloss" id="i450g0">his cache</span><span class="gloss" id="i450g1">upon</span><span class="gloss" id="i450g2">he went up</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i450ft'>'He went up on his cache.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i451'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/452.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i451w'><span class="word" id="i451w0">Niɬ'in</span><span class="word" id="i451w1">gitsaghth</span><span class="word" id="i451w2">da'</span><span class="word" id="i451w3">xiɬdi</span><span class="word" id="i451w4">xits'in'</span><span class="word" id="i451w5">tthan'elyo</span><span class="word" id="i451w6">xiɬdi</span><span class="word" id="i451w7">xinxidighelo.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i451g'><span class="gloss" id="i451g0">both</span><span class="gloss" id="i451g1">marten skin</span><span class="gloss" id="i451g2">parka</span><span class="gloss" id="i451g3">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i451g4">to them</span><span class="gloss" id="i451g5">he took</span><span class="gloss" id="i451g6">and then</span><span class="gloss" id="i451g7">he put them on them</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i451ft'>'He brought marten parks to them both and put them on them.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i452'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/453.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i452w'><span class="word" id="i452w0">Xiɬdi</span><span class="word" id="i452w1">iy'odi</span><span class="word" id="i452w2">sanh tux</span><span class="word" id="i452w3">atthegh</span><span class="word" id="i452w4">nchiyath</span><span class="word" id="i452w5">xelanh</span><span class="word" id="i452w6">ts'in'</span><span class="word" id="i452w7">xinxighe'o</span><span class="word" id="i452w8">ts'in'.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i452g'><span class="gloss" id="i452g0">and</span><span class="gloss" id="i452g1">that</span><span class="gloss" id="i452g2">summer</span><span class="gloss" id="i452g3">down by water</span><span class="gloss" id="i452g4">hummocks</span><span class="gloss" id="i452g5">they are</span><span class="gloss" id="i452g6"></span><span class="gloss" id="i452g7">they're sticking up</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i452ft'>'And they sat side by side transformed into tussocks of grass.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i453'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/454.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i453w'><span class="word" id="i453w0">Yitots'in'</span><span class="word" id="i453w1">yit</span><span class="word" id="i453w2">xathdo</span><span class="word" id="i453w3">ine'</span><span class="word" id="i453w4">xidigaɬ</span><span class="word" id="i453w5">xizron</span><span class="word" id="i453w6">nigeday</span><span class="word" id="i453w7">ngilanh</span><span class="word" id="i453w8">ts'in'</span><span class="word" id="i453w9">yidelninghdi,</span><span class="word" id="i453w10">ngido'</span><span class="word" id="i453w11">e</span><span class="word" id="i453w12">q'agh</span><span class="word" id="i453w13">eyggi</span><span class="word" id="i453w14">xits'in'</span><span class="word" id="i453w15">nixididatl</span><span class="word" id="i453w16">yit.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i453g'><span class="gloss" id="i453g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i453g1">there</span><span class="gloss" id="i453g2">they sat</span><span class="gloss" id="i453g3">but</span><span class="gloss" id="i453g4">finally</span><span class="gloss" id="i453g5">indeed</span><span class="gloss" id="i453g6">hawk</span><span class="gloss" id="i453g7">he is</span><span class="gloss" id="i453g8"></span><span class="gloss" id="i453g9">he flew off suddenly</span><span class="gloss" id="i453g10">down</span><span class="gloss" id="i453g11">yes</span><span class="gloss" id="i453g12">back</span><span class="gloss" id="i453g13">those</span><span class="gloss" id="i453g14">to them</span><span class="gloss" id="i453g15">they went</span><span class="gloss" id="i453g16">there</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i453ft'>'Then he turned into a hawk and flew off swiftly back downriver, back downriver to the people he had known before.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i454'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/455.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i454w'><span class="word" id="i454w0">Geɬix</span><span class="word" id="i454w1">yuxudz</span><span class="word" id="i454w2">eyiggi</span><span class="word" id="i454w3">ngido'</span><span class="word" id="i454w4">qay</span><span class="word" id="i454w5">xits'i</span><span class="word" id="i454w6">yu'odi</span><span class="word" id="i454w7">dinitht'uqdi</span><span class="word" id="i454w8">ndixidiɬniyh</span><span class="word" id="i454w9">di</span><span class="word" id="i454w10">xizronche.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i454g'><span class="gloss" id="i454g0">at once</span><span class="gloss" id="i454g1">really</span><span class="gloss" id="i454g2">those</span><span class="gloss" id="i454g3">downriver</span><span class="gloss" id="i454g4">village</span><span class="gloss" id="i454g5">to them</span><span class="gloss" id="i454g6">close</span><span class="gloss" id="i454g7">he flew</span><span class="gloss" id="i454g8">when</span><span class="gloss" id="i454g9">they were excited</span><span class="gloss" id="i454g10">indeed</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i454ft'>'As he approached close to the village they were excited.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i455'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/456.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i455w'><span class="word" id="i455w0">Aɬona</span><span class="word" id="i455w1">xiɬdi</span><span class="word" id="i455w2">xiyoqo di'nedi</span><span class="word" id="i455w3">eygginh</span><span class="word" id="i455w4">nuq'oɬonh.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i455g'><span class="gloss" id="i455g0">behold</span><span class="gloss" id="i455g1">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i455g2">they were talking about her</span><span class="gloss" id="i455g3">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i455g4">that person</span><span class="gloss" id="i455g5">woman</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i455ft'>'You see, they were talking about that woman.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i456'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/457.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i456w'><span class="word" id="i456w0">Axaxiɬdik</span><span class="word" id="i456w1">go</span><span class="word" id="i456w2">qay</span><span class="word" id="i456w3">xonigg</span><span class="word" id="i456w4">didlang</span><span class="word" id="i456w5">ngith</span><span class="word" id="i456w6">yuxudz</span><span class="word" id="i456w7">yit</span><span class="word" id="i456w8">xindighe'oy</span><span class="word" id="i456w9">loy</span><span class="word" id="i456w10">dinitht'uq,</span><span class="word" id="i456w11">xiyiɬ</span><span class="word" id="i456w12">xizronche</span><span class="word" id="i456w13">nonsriltr'idilughosrdi</span><span class="word" id="i456w14">go</span><span class="word" id="i456w15">qay.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i456g'><span class="gloss" id="i456g0">now</span><span class="gloss" id="i456g1">this</span><span class="gloss" id="i456g2">village</span><span class="gloss" id="i456g3">behind</span><span class="gloss" id="i456g4">spruce</span><span class="gloss" id="i456g5">tall</span><span class="gloss" id="i456g6">just</span><span class="gloss" id="i456g7">there</span><span class="gloss" id="i456g8">which sticks up</span><span class="gloss" id="i456g9">end</span><span class="gloss" id="i456g10">he landed</span><span class="gloss" id="i456g11">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i456g12">indeed</span><span class="gloss" id="i456g13">when they set up a shout</span><span class="gloss" id="i456g14">this</span><span class="gloss" id="i456g15">village</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i456ft'>'Behind the village he landed at the top of a big spruce tree and at that they all shouted.'<a href="#n81" class="notelink">81</a></span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i457'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/458.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i457w'><span class="word" id="i457w0">Nigozrag</span><span class="word" id="i457w1">ginghe'oy</span><span class="word" id="i457w2">q'idz</span><span class="word" id="i457w3">don'itht'uq</span><span class="word" id="i457w4">tr'i'ne</span><span class="word" id="i457w5">ts'in',</span><span class="word" id="i457w6">xiɬdik</span><span class="word" id="i457w7">go</span><span class="word" id="i457w8">nonsrilxidaɬdaq</span><span class="word" id="i457w9">xiɬdi</span><span class="word" id="i457w10">xuxititldheɬ</span><span class="word" id="i457w11">hingo.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i457g'><span class="gloss" id="i457g0">(personal name)</span><span class="gloss" id="i457g1">tree</span><span class="gloss" id="i457g2">upon</span><span class="gloss" id="i457g3">he has landed</span><span class="gloss" id="i457g4">one said</span><span class="gloss" id="i457g5">as</span><span class="gloss" id="i457g6">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i457g7">here</span><span class="gloss" id="i457g8">they all shouted</span><span class="gloss" id="i457g9">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i457g10">they rushed</span><span class="gloss" id="i457g11">while</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i457ft'>'He has landed on <em>Nigozrag's</em> tree someone said, and they all rushed there shouting.'<a href="#n82" class="notelink">82</a></span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i458'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/459.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i458w'><span class="word" id="i458w0">Axaxiɬdik</span><span class="word" id="i458w1">yuxudz</span><span class="word" id="i458w2">anhtr'a</span><span class="word" id="i458w3">vits'in'</span><span class="word" id="i458w4">xidighelyak.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i458g'><span class="gloss" id="i458g0">now</span><span class="gloss" id="i458g1"></span><span class="gloss" id="i458g2">just like</span><span class="gloss" id="i458g3">to it</span><span class="gloss" id="i458g4">they banked up</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i458ft'>'They started banking up earth around it.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i459'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/460.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i459w'><span class="word" id="i459w0">Xiyiggi</span><span class="word" id="i459w1">xiyk'odz</span><span class="word" id="i459w2">niginetotl</span><span class="word" id="i459w3">xiyiɬ.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i459g'><span class="gloss" id="i459g0">as soon as</span><span class="gloss" id="i459g1">against it</span><span class="gloss" id="i459g2">he kicked it</span><span class="gloss" id="i459g3">then</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i459ft'>'Immediately he kicked against it with his feet.'<a href="#n83" class="notelink">83</a></span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i460'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/461.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i460w'><span class="word" id="i460w0">Diginathtl'enh,</span><span class="word" id="i460w1">tr'i'ne.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i460g'><span class="gloss" id="i460g0">he was snared</span><span class="gloss" id="i460g1">they say</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i460ft'>'He was snared, they say.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i461'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/462.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i461w'><span class="word" id="i461w0">Ts'an</span><span class="word" id="i461w1">xiyiyiɬ yidenathtonh.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i461g'><span class="gloss" id="i461g0">so</span><span class="gloss" id="i461g1">they drew him down</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i461ft'>'And they brought him down.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i462'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/463.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i462w'><span class="word" id="i462w0">&quot;Dingit'adi</span><span class="word" id="i462w1">go</span><span class="word" id="i462w2">uxudiniy</span><span class="word" id="i462w3">q'aveɬ</span><span class="word" id="i462w4">ye</span><span class="word" id="i462w5">tr'isiniɬtayh</span><span class="word" id="i462w6">ts'in',</span><span class="word" id="i462w7">ngi'in</span><span class="word" id="i462w8">ts'i</span><span class="word" id="i462w9">soghluqye</span><span class="word" id="i462w10">ayiggi</span><span class="word" id="i462w11">tthuxdi</span><span class="word" id="i462w12">qay</span><span class="word" id="i462w13">xichet</span><span class="word" id="i462w14">didltth'en</span><span class="word" id="i462w15">xivogh nisiɬtayh,&quot;</span><span class="word" id="i462w16">yentr'atitl'iningh,</span><span class="word" id="i462w17">tr'i'ne.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i462g'><span class="gloss" id="i462g0">I wish</span><span class="gloss" id="i462g1">this</span><span class="gloss" id="i462g2">quickly</span><span class="gloss" id="i462g3">snare</span><span class="gloss" id="i462g4">in</span><span class="gloss" id="i462g5">they release me</span><span class="gloss" id="i462g6">and</span><span class="gloss" id="i462g7">yonder</span><span class="gloss" id="i462g8">to</span><span class="gloss" id="i462g9">dear pl.</span><span class="gloss" id="i462g10">over there</span><span class="gloss" id="i462g11">alone</span><span class="gloss" id="i462g12">village</span><span class="gloss" id="i462g13">end</span><span class="gloss" id="i462g14">they who live</span><span class="gloss" id="i462g15">bring me to them</span><span class="gloss" id="i462g16">he made up his mind</span><span class="gloss" id="i462g17">they say</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i462ft'>'I wish they would let me out of this snare, and bring me to my friends over there at the end of the village.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i463'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/464.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i463w'><span class="word" id="i463w0">Yitots'in'</span><span class="word" id="i463w1">yuxudz</span><span class="word" id="i463w2">dixiyeloq.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i463g'><span class="gloss" id="i463g0">so then</span><span class="gloss" id="i463g1">thus</span><span class="gloss" id="i463g2">they did it</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i463ft'>'And that is just what they did.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i464'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/465.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i464w'><span class="word" id="i464w0">Q'aveɬ</span><span class="word" id="i464w1">ye</span><span class="word" id="i464w2">tr'ixiyniɬghiɬ</span><span class="word" id="i464w3">ts'in'.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i464g'><span class="gloss" id="i464g0">snare</span><span class="gloss" id="i464g1">in</span><span class="gloss" id="i464g2">they pulled off</span><span class="gloss" id="i464g3">so</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i464ft'>'They pulled the snare off him.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i465'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/466.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i465w'><span class="word" id="i465w0">Yitots'in'</span><span class="word" id="i465w1">&quot;gila,</span><span class="word" id="i465w2">ngi'in</span><span class="word" id="i465w3">gila</span><span class="word" id="i465w4">yuxgitsiy</span><span class="word" id="i465w5">soghluq</span><span class="word" id="i465w6">xivogh'odz</span><span class="word" id="i465w7">yinuxɬtayh</span><span class="word" id="i465w8">uxudiniy</span><span class="word" id="i465w9">xiyatilvadr,&quot;</span><span class="word" id="i465w10">xaɬne.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i465g'><span class="gloss" id="i465g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i465g1">go ahead</span><span class="gloss" id="i465g2">yonder</span><span class="gloss" id="i465g3">now</span><span class="gloss" id="i465g4">your (pl.) grandmother</span><span class="gloss" id="i465g5">dear</span><span class="gloss" id="i465g6">to them</span><span class="gloss" id="i465g7">you (pl.) take him</span><span class="gloss" id="i465g8">quickly</span><span class="gloss" id="i465g9">what they'll cook for themselves</span><span class="gloss" id="i465g10">they said</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i465ft'>'Then they said, &quot;take him over there to the little old ladies and they will cook him.&quot;'<a href="#n84" class="notelink">84</a></span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i466'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/467.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i466w'><span class="word" id="i466w0">Yuxudz</span><span class="word" id="i466w1">dixiyeloq.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i466g'><span class="gloss" id="i466g0">thus</span><span class="gloss" id="i466g1">they did it</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i466ft'>'And so they did.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i467'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/468.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i467w'><span class="word" id="i467w0">Xughun'</span><span class="word" id="i467w1">xidixiyniɬtanh.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i467g'><span class="gloss" id="i467g0">to them</span><span class="gloss" id="i467g1">they took him inside</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i467ft'>'They took him to them.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i468'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/469.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i468w'><span class="word" id="i468w0">&quot;Oghda',</span><span class="word" id="i468w1">gila</span><span class="word" id="i468w2">uxudiniy,&quot;</span><span class="word" id="i468w3">yiɬne.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i468g'><span class="gloss" id="i468g0">cousin</span><span class="gloss" id="i468g1">go ahead</span><span class="gloss" id="i468g2">quickly</span><span class="gloss" id="i468g3">he said</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i468ft'>&quot;'Cousin, come quickly,&quot; she said.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i469'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/470.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i469w'><span class="word" id="i469w0">Yuxudz</span><span class="word" id="i469w1">yitthughon'itlch'iɬ.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i469g'><span class="gloss" id="i469g0">just</span><span class="gloss" id="i469g1">(they) skinned him</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i469ft'>'Right away they pulled off his skin.'<a href="#n85" class="notelink">85</a></span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i470'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/471.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i470w'><span class="word" id="i470w0">Yit</span><span class="word" id="i470w1">xiyighoned</span><span class="word" id="i470w2">tthagg</span><span class="word" id="i470w3">nigidiniɬningh</span><span class="word" id="i470w4">ts'in'</span><span class="word" id="i470w5">yitots'in'</span><span class="word" id="i470w6">yuxudz</span><span class="word" id="i470w7">xiviyiɬ</span><span class="word" id="i470w8">ginighaɬch'ux</span><span class="word" id="i470w9">ts'in'.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i470g'><span class="gloss" id="i470g0">there</span><span class="gloss" id="i470g1">they for it</span><span class="gloss" id="i470g2">fireplace</span><span class="gloss" id="i470g3">they put something on</span><span class="gloss" id="i470g4"></span><span class="gloss" id="i470g5">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i470g6">just</span><span class="gloss" id="i470g7">with them</span><span class="gloss" id="i470g8">it was boiling</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i470ft'>'They put him in the pot that was boiling on the fireplace.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i471'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/472.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i471w'><span class="word" id="i471w0">Dixiyiniɬqon'</span><span class="word" id="i471w1">ts'in',</span><span class="word" id="i471w2">xiyghehon'</span><span class="word" id="i471w3">uxudiniy,</span><span class="word" id="i471w4">yuxudz</span><span class="word" id="i471w5">eyggi</span><span class="word" id="i471w6">xiytth'in</span><span class="word" id="i471w7">yiɬ</span><span class="word" id="i471w8">xiytth'ithgi</span><span class="word" id="i471w9">yiɬ.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i471g'><span class="gloss" id="i471g0">they dipped it out</span><span class="gloss" id="i471g1"></span><span class="gloss" id="i471g2">they ate it</span><span class="gloss" id="i471g3">hurriedly</span><span class="gloss" id="i471g4">everything</span><span class="gloss" id="i471g5">that</span><span class="gloss" id="i471g6">they its bones</span><span class="gloss" id="i471g7">too</span><span class="gloss" id="i471g8">they its feathers</span><span class="gloss" id="i471g9">too</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i471ft'>'And as soon as they pulled him out they ate him all up, everything bones and feathers and all.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i472'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/473.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i472w'><span class="word" id="i472w0">Engthi</span><span class="word" id="i472w1">xitthixiydighengiɬ.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i472g'><span class="gloss" id="i472g0">out in the middle</span><span class="gloss" id="i472g1">they threw it in the fire</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i472ft'>'They threw into the fire.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i473'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/474.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i473w'><span class="word" id="i473w0">Yitoyiggi</span><span class="word" id="i473w1">ngu'ot</span><span class="word" id="i473w2">anhtr'a</span><span class="word" id="i473w3">nontr'aghɬquyh</span><span class="word" id="i473w4">xiq'i.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i473g'><span class="gloss" id="i473g0">immediately</span><span class="gloss" id="i473g1">outside</span><span class="gloss" id="i473g2">as if</span><span class="gloss" id="i473g3">he had jumped down</span><span class="gloss" id="i473g4">as if</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i473ft'>'At that moment it was as if he had jumped down outside.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i474'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/475.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i474w'><span class="word" id="i474w0">Axaxiɬdik</span><span class="word" id="i474w1">yiggi yeg</span><span class="word" id="i474w2">gan che</span><span class="word" id="i474w3">go deg</span><span class="word" id="i474w4">ngin' qogg</span><span class="word" id="i474w5">vixelaninh</span><span class="word" id="i474w6">tritr</span><span class="word" id="i474w7">iy'odi</span><span class="word" id="i474w8">eyiggi</span><span class="word" id="i474w9">xiɬdik</span><span class="word" id="i474w10">diggits'in'</span><span class="word" id="i474w11">ngin' qogg</span><span class="word" id="i474w12">xiq'a ntitl'inek.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i474g'><span class="gloss" id="i474g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i474g1">around there</span><span class="gloss" id="i474g2">something</span><span class="gloss" id="i474g3">here</span><span class="gloss" id="i474g4">on its surface</span><span class="gloss" id="i474g5">that which is</span><span class="gloss" id="i474g6">wood</span><span class="gloss" id="i474g7">those things</span><span class="gloss" id="i474g8">that</span><span class="gloss" id="i474g9">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i474g10">upward</span><span class="gloss" id="i474g11">on earth</span><span class="gloss" id="i474g12">he tried to get</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i474ft'>'It was as if he had broken through the surface of the earth, trying to climb up through the pieces of wood.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i475'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/476.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i475w'><span class="word" id="i475w0">Ine'</span><span class="word" id="i475w1">che</span><span class="word" id="i475w2">go deg</span><span class="word" id="i475w3">xits'i</span><span class="word" id="i475w4">non'idoyh</span><span class="word" id="i475w5">ine'</span><span class="word" id="i475w6">xitthe'iɬquyh</span><span class="word" id="i475w7">q'agh</span><span class="word" id="i475w8">yiggits'in'.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i475g'><span class="gloss" id="i475g0">but</span><span class="gloss" id="i475g1">again</span><span class="gloss" id="i475g2">here</span><span class="gloss" id="i475g3">from</span><span class="gloss" id="i475g4">he goes so far</span><span class="gloss" id="i475g5">but</span><span class="gloss" id="i475g6">he bumped his head</span><span class="gloss" id="i475g7">back</span><span class="gloss" id="i475g8">downward</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i475ft'>'But everytime he bumped his head and fell back down.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i476'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/477.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i476w'><span class="word" id="i476w0">Yuxudz yiggi yeg</span><span class="word" id="i476w1">gidingidz</span><span class="word" id="i476w2">yiɬ</span><span class="word" id="i476w3">edi</span><span class="word" id="i476w4">go</span><span class="word" id="i476w5">vixelanh</span><span class="word" id="i476w6">ngi'egh</span><span class="word" id="i476w7">xinithinek.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i476g'><span class="gloss" id="i476g0">all else</span><span class="gloss" id="i476g1">grass</span><span class="gloss" id="i476g2">also</span><span class="gloss" id="i476g3">entire</span><span class="gloss" id="i476g4">here</span><span class="gloss" id="i476g5">that is</span><span class="gloss" id="i476g6">outside</span><span class="gloss" id="i476g7">he tried</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i476ft'>'He tried getting up through the grass.'<a href="#n86" class="notelink">86</a></span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i477'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/478.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i477w'><span class="word" id="i477w0">Axaxiɬdik</span><span class="word" id="i477w1">cheche</span><span class="word" id="i477w2">geɬix</span><span class="word" id="i477w3">che</span><span class="word" id="i477w4">donyeloq</span><span class="word" id="i477w5">yuxudz</span><span class="word" id="i477w6">xoghdenolts'in'</span><span class="word" id="i477w7">dixizronche.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i477g'><span class="gloss" id="i477g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i477g1">again</span><span class="gloss" id="i477g2">once more</span><span class="gloss" id="i477g3">again</span><span class="gloss" id="i477g4">he did it again</span><span class="gloss" id="i477g5">entirely</span><span class="gloss" id="i477g6">he never touched</span><span class="gloss" id="i477g7">indeed</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i477ft'>'Then he tried one more time and he never touched anything.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i478'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/479.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i478w'><span class="word" id="i478w0">Ngidigg</span><span class="word" id="i478w1">xonghiliq'ak.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i478g'><span class="gloss" id="i478g0">up</span><span class="gloss" id="i478g1">he soared up</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i478ft'>'He soared up.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i479'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/480.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i479w'><span class="word" id="i479w0">Ey</span><span class="word" id="i479w1">gogide</span><span class="word" id="i479w2">deg</span><span class="word" id="i479w3">ngin' qogg</span><span class="word" id="i479w4">xizronche</span><span class="word" id="i479w5">go</span><span class="word" id="i479w6">do'egh</span><span class="word" id="i479w7">q'odet</span><span class="word" id="i479w8">ngin' qogg</span><span class="word" id="i479w9">xelanh</span><span class="word" id="i479w10">xiq'i</span><span class="word" id="i479w11">yuxudz</span><span class="word" id="i479w12">ngine' ts'in'</span><span class="word" id="i479w13">ts'ixinagh</span><span class="word" id="i479w14">don'idiyoq,</span><span class="word" id="i479w15">eyggi</span><span class="word" id="i479w16">vidithinqay</span><span class="word" id="i479w17">soghluqye</span><span class="word" id="i479w18">xidighaɬtth'idi</span><span class="word" id="i479w19">xits'idz.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i479g'><span class="gloss" id="i479g0">yes</span><span class="gloss" id="i479g1">here</span><span class="gloss" id="i479g2">here</span><span class="gloss" id="i479g3">surface of earth</span><span class="gloss" id="i479g4">for sure</span><span class="gloss" id="i479g5">here</span><span class="gloss" id="i479g6">around us</span><span class="gloss" id="i479g7">now</span><span class="gloss" id="i479g8">on earth</span><span class="gloss" id="i479g9">it is</span><span class="gloss" id="i479g10">like</span><span class="gloss" id="i479g11">very much</span><span class="gloss" id="i479g12">upriver</span><span class="gloss" id="i479g13">to only</span><span class="gloss" id="i479g14">he went</span><span class="gloss" id="i479g15">those</span><span class="gloss" id="i479g16">his parents</span><span class="gloss" id="i479g17">dear pl.</span><span class="gloss" id="i479g18">where they sat</span><span class="gloss" id="i479g19">towards</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i479ft'>'He flew back upriver (as a spirit) toward where his parents were.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i480'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/481.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i480w'><span class="word" id="i480w0">Geɬixi</span><span class="word" id="i480w1">yuxudz</span><span class="word" id="i480w2">yit</span><span class="word" id="i480w3">donxeloq</span><span class="word" id="i480w4">ine'.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i480g'><span class="gloss" id="i480g0">one moment</span><span class="gloss" id="i480g1">just</span><span class="gloss" id="i480g2">there</span><span class="gloss" id="i480g3">he went back</span><span class="gloss" id="i480g4">even</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i480ft'>'He arrived there in the space of a moment.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i481'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/482.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i481w'><span class="word" id="i481w0">Daɬine'</span><span class="word" id="i481w1">iy</span><span class="word" id="i481w2">cheche</span><span class="word" id="i481w3">niɬdhod</span><span class="word" id="i481w4">ts'in'</span><span class="word" id="i481w5">di'et'al ts'in'</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i481g'><span class="gloss" id="i481g0">but</span><span class="gloss" id="i481g1">there</span><span class="gloss" id="i481g2">again</span><span class="gloss" id="i481g3">long</span><span class="gloss" id="i481g4"></span><span class="gloss" id="i481g5">he wasn't</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i481ft'>'However he did not remain there long.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i482'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/483.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i482w'><span class="word" id="i482w0">Q'agh</span><span class="word" id="i482w1">che</span><span class="word" id="i482w2">ngido'ts'i</span><span class="word" id="i482w3">donxeloq.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i482g'><span class="gloss" id="i482g0">back</span><span class="gloss" id="i482g1">again</span><span class="gloss" id="i482g2">downriver</span><span class="gloss" id="i482g3">he went back</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i482ft'>'But he went back down again.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i483'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/484.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i483w'><span class="word" id="i483w0">Che</span><span class="word" id="i483w1">geɬixi</span><span class="word" id="i483w2">yuxudz</span><span class="word" id="i483w3">ngido'</span><span class="word" id="i483w4">yit</span><span class="word" id="i483w5">donxeloq</span><span class="word" id="i483w6">eyggi</span><span class="word" id="i483w7">iy.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i483g'><span class="gloss" id="i483g0">again</span><span class="gloss" id="i483g1">at once</span><span class="gloss" id="i483g2">all</span><span class="gloss" id="i483g3">down</span><span class="gloss" id="i483g4">there</span><span class="gloss" id="i483g5">he arrived</span><span class="gloss" id="i483g6">that</span><span class="gloss" id="i483g7">it</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i483ft'>'In another moment he arrived there.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i484'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/485.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i484w'><span class="word" id="i484w0">Eyggi</span><span class="word" id="i484w1">iy</span><span class="word" id="i484w2">didlang</span><span class="word" id="i484w3">loy</span><span class="word" id="i484w4">che</span><span class="word" id="i484w5">don'ithiyo.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i484g'><span class="gloss" id="i484g0">that</span><span class="gloss" id="i484g1">it</span><span class="gloss" id="i484g2">spruce</span><span class="gloss" id="i484g3">top</span><span class="gloss" id="i484g4">again</span><span class="gloss" id="i484g5">he landed on again</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i484ft'>'He alit on top of the same spruce.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i485'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/486.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i485w'><span class="word" id="i485w0">Uxuxuyiɬ</span><span class="word" id="i485w1">nonyidoɬtanh.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i485g'><span class="gloss" id="i485g0">same time</span><span class="gloss" id="i485g1">everyone screamed</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i485ft'>'At that everyone shouted.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i486'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/487.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i486w'><span class="word" id="i486w0">&quot;Nigozra(g)</span><span class="word" id="i486w1">ginighe'oy</span><span class="word" id="i486w2">q'idz</span><span class="word" id="i486w3">don'ithiyo,&quot;</span><span class="word" id="i486w4">vazrne</span><span class="word" id="i486w5">ts'in'.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i486g'><span class="gloss" id="i486g0">(personal name)</span><span class="gloss" id="i486g1">tree</span><span class="gloss" id="i486g2">upon</span><span class="gloss" id="i486g3">he landed on again</span><span class="gloss" id="i486g4">one is saying</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i486ft'>'He has landed on Nigozrag's tree.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i487'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/488.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i487w'><span class="word" id="i487w0">Che</span><span class="word" id="i487w1">nuxuxiditldheɬ</span><span class="word" id="i487w2">yitoyiggi</span><span class="word" id="i487w3">dadz gidenitlningh di.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i487g'><span class="gloss" id="i487g0">again</span><span class="gloss" id="i487g1">they rushed to it</span><span class="gloss" id="i487g2">thereupon</span><span class="gloss" id="i487g3">he looked sidewise</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i487ft'>'Again they rushed to it and he looked sidewise.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i488'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/489.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i488w'><span class="word" id="i488w0">Go</span><span class="word" id="i488w1">xizronche</span><span class="word" id="i488w2">q'aveɬ</span><span class="word" id="i488w3">ye</span><span class="word" id="i488w4">xitthaghɬ'o.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i488g'><span class="gloss" id="i488g0">here</span><span class="gloss" id="i488g1">indeed</span><span class="gloss" id="i488g2">snare</span><span class="gloss" id="i488g3">in</span><span class="gloss" id="i488g4">he stuck his head</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i488ft'>'He stuck his head through the snare.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i489'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/490.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i489w'><span class="word" id="i489w0">Yuxudz</span><span class="word" id="i489w1">ngithi</span><span class="word" id="i489w2">yiniɬtrit</span><span class="word" id="i489w3">hingo,</span><span class="word" id="i489w4">k'odz</span><span class="word" id="i489w5">yan-giditotl.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i489g'><span class="gloss" id="i489g0">thus</span><span class="gloss" id="i489g1">away</span><span class="gloss" id="i489g2">he pushed it</span><span class="gloss" id="i489g3">while</span><span class="gloss" id="i489g4">off</span><span class="gloss" id="i489g5">he got away</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i489ft'>'But he pushed it away and sprang off.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i490'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/491.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i490w'><span class="word" id="i490w0">Axaxiɬdik</span><span class="word" id="i490w1">ngine'</span><span class="word" id="i490w2">iɬt'et,</span><span class="word" id="i490w3">ngine'</span><span class="word" id="i490w4">eyggi</span><span class="word" id="i490w5">didithinqay</span><span class="word" id="i490w6">soghluqye</span><span class="word" id="i490w7">ghodixi</span><span class="word" id="i490w8">xiɬdi</span><span class="word" id="i490w9">che</span><span class="word" id="i490w10">don'initht'uq.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i490g'><span class="gloss" id="i490g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i490g1">upriver</span><span class="gloss" id="i490g2">continuously</span><span class="gloss" id="i490g3">upriver</span><span class="gloss" id="i490g4">that one</span><span class="gloss" id="i490g5">his parents</span><span class="gloss" id="i490g6">dear (pl.)</span><span class="gloss" id="i490g7">above</span><span class="gloss" id="i490g8">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i490g9">again</span><span class="gloss" id="i490g10">he landed again</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i490ft'>'Then (he went) upriver again, upriver to his dear parents, and there he alit.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i491'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/492.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i491w'><span class="word" id="i491w0">Yit</span><span class="word" id="i491w1">dighedo'</span><span class="word" id="i491w2">ine'</span><span class="word" id="i491w3">xiɬdi</span><span class="word" id="i491w4">viyan'.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i491g'><span class="gloss" id="i491g0">there</span><span class="gloss" id="i491g1">he stayed</span><span class="gloss" id="i491g2">but</span><span class="gloss" id="i491g3">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i491g4">no use</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i491ft'>'He stayed there but to no avail.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i492'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/493.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i492w'><span class="word" id="i492w0">Axaxiɬdik</span><span class="word" id="i492w1">dodo</span><span class="word" id="i492w2">xiɬdik.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i492g'><span class="gloss" id="i492g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i492g1">that's all</span><span class="gloss" id="i492g2">then</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i492ft'>'That's all that happened.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i493'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/494.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i493w'><span class="word" id="i493w0">Axaxiɬdik</span><span class="word" id="i493w1">k'odz</span><span class="word" id="i493w2">yan-gididitotl</span><span class="word" id="i493w3">axaxiɬdik,</span><span class="word" id="i493w4">ndaɬts'idz</span><span class="word" id="i493w5">sre'.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i493g'><span class="gloss" id="i493g0">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i493g1">off</span><span class="gloss" id="i493g2">he got away</span><span class="gloss" id="i493g3">then</span><span class="gloss" id="i493g4">where</span><span class="gloss" id="i493g5">not known</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i493ft'>'He flew away again, I wonder where.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i494'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/495.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i494w'><span class="word" id="i494w0">Dodo</span><span class="word" id="i494w1">yitots'in'.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i494g'><span class="gloss" id="i494g0">that's all</span><span class="gloss" id="i494g1">then</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i494ft'>'That's all then'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i495'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/496.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i495w'><span class="word" id="i495w0">E,</span><span class="word" id="i495w1">idixinlu'on'.</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i495g'><span class="gloss" id="i495g0">yes</span><span class="gloss" id="i495g1">end</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i495ft'>'Yes, that is the end.'</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i496'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Chapman/7__Avenger/mp3/497.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i496w'><span class="word" id="i496w0">Yuk!</span></span><br /><span class='glosses' id='i496g'><span class="gloss" id="i496g0">(listener's response at end of story)</span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i496ft'></span></p></li>
</ol></div><div id='notes'><h2>Notes</h2><ol><li><span class="footnote" id="n1">In Chapman's version, this sentence starts with <em> a, </em> which he glosses 'oh!' and which is glossed 'then' in Kari's version.</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n2"><em> tr'idexiyene' </em> also means 'they started to hate him' (ED)</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n3">ED uses both <em> traɬtth'e(t) </em> and <em> sraɬtth'e(t) </em> for 'kashim', as do other speakers.</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n4">Chapman has <em> dûtäsnĭˊɬ </em> 'shall I do' here.</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n5">Chapman translates <em> triyuˊrz-û </em> here as 'kyak', elsewhere as 'canoe'.</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n6">Chapman's free translation</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n7">This is close to Chapman's free translation. Kari's free translation:  'But never fear I will come back soon.'</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n8">Kari explains:  the skin of its head</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n9"><em> soogha </em> (Kari's spelling) in Holikachuk (Deg Xinag is <em> segha).</em></span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n10">This series of sentence fragments is as punctuated by Chapman.</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n11">Chapman's translation of <em> xididine'onh </em> is 'shut off' is </span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n12">Chapman: 'They paddled towards it and soon were not far away.'</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n13">Q\'oxoûû\'n tdûcr\'ecr dĭceh\'oĭltz\'an a yĭɬnĭ.</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n14">Chapman translates <em> vido' </em> 'middle portion', and in the free translation has 'that's it, in the middle (of the song) there is something.'</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n15">Kari has <em> xitidhiqanh </em> here.</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n16">Chapman has <em> dĭtäɬ'ă\'n'. </em> ED wasn't sure about <em> ditaɬ'an' </em> here or in the next sentence.</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n17">Chapman glosses <em> vidaɬtuq </em> as 'he let fly'.  The previous word in Chapman's story is <em> dĭt\'oxwûăˊndlû, </em> which Kari interpreted as <em> ixudiniy (</em> here <em> uxudiniy).  Chapman's free translation makes clear what is going at this point in the story:  'With a quick motion, he hurled a spear.'</em></span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n18">Chapman's free translation:  'On the instant, the young man lifted himself (clear of the boat by grasping the gunwales).'</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n19">This is Chapman's free translation.</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n20">Chapman's free translation</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n21">Chapman's English version supplies some of the story line, not found in the Deg Xinag version: 'He recovered it with the other arm and threw it again. But the young man did the same that he had done before.'</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n22">Chapman's free translation</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n23">Chapman's free translation</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n24">Chapman's sentence punctuation</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n25">Chapman's free translation</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n26">Chapman's free translation. <em> viloy yighe'oy </em> 'that (inanimate) which is on his/her/its end' seems to be a poetic way of referring to 'his head'.</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n27">Chapman glossed <em> ditigheɬ'el ts'in' </em> 'you will not serve'.</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n28">Chapman's free translation</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n29">Chapman had <em> nĭgŏdokhwŭɬdŭ </em> 'something showed white'. ED wasn't sure about <em> ngi'iluq'uɬ.</em></span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n30">Kari has <em> ay'oogh </em> instead of <em> ay'egh.</em></span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n31">Chapman's free translation</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n32">Kari has <em> viqigitr'idinighiɬningh.</em></span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n33">Kari has <em> vanditl'ichek. </em> ED was not sure about this word.</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n34">Kari has 'went back to her house'. Not long after, she does go into her house.</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n35">Chapman's free translation</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n36">Chapman's free translation</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n37">Chapman's free translation</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n38">based on Chapman's free translation</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n39">Chapman glosses <em> n-go </em> 'indeed here'</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n40">ED uses both <em> q'idaghdhilinh </em> and <em> gidaghdhilinh.</em></span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n41">'he bent his head' is Chapman/Kari's gloss of <em> nigidentl'ininghdi; </em> ED suggested 'he quickly looked'.</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n42">Chapman has <em> yeq </em> 'hurrah'.</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n43">Chapman's gloss is 'yes!'</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n44">Chapman/Kari have <em> (ngi)tthing nitthixudalning </em> 'downward don't turn'.</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n45">Chapman has <em> -tthiyh </em> (mink style of crawling?) instead of <em> -ggisr.</em></span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n46">Chapman's sentence punctuation</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n47">Chapman's translation of <em> dixiditldaq </em> is 'they will be quiet'. Chapman's free translation: 'They will never make any more trouble.'</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n48">Chapman: 'was it shoved?'</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n49">For 'stake protrudes' Kari has <em> xun-gididighe'o, based on Chapman's </em> q\'ongĭdûxai\'o.</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n50">This is Chapman's translation of <em> tr'igidiɬt'ighinh. </em> More generally, this refers to someone (male or female) who is too choosy to get married.</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n51">Kari has <em> tthetixughedhit, </em> based on Chapman's <em> tçeˊtdûqaiˊûceˊt.</em></span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n52">Chapman/Kari have <em> xiq'idz </em> 'above' instead of <em> xiq'idh </em> 'beside'.</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n53">Kari has <em> idigozrag </em> (not glossed) instead of ED's <em> xalzrag. </em> Kari has <em> nixiyughilayinh anh, </em> based on Chapman's <em> nĭx\'axyûkh-lla\'i-an </em> 'would be tribesman'. ED says this word further below, as <em> nixighyolayin.</em></span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n54">Chapman's free translation: 'They ran out into the entrance.'</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n55">Kari has <em> xiyighun' ndighidididaɬ, </em> based on Chapman's <em> qai-yŏˊxŏ-ntdûxûdetdäˊll. </em> ED wasn't sure about this.</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n56">'run (up on it)' was Chapman's gloss of his version of <em> nasrilugguyh.</em></span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n57">Chapman's translation for <em> xiq'i dixet'a xiyiɬ </em> is 'seemingly also'</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n58">Instead of <em> xinthighisr, </em> Kari has <em> niɬigitl'ighosr, </em> based on Chapman's <em> nĭɬĭgĭtloxwŏrs.</em></span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n59">Chapman's free translation for this sentence is combined with the next:  'Cousin, said one of them, you over there, what has this grandson of ours come to see us for?'</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n60">Kari has <em> xungitolneɬ </em> in place of <em> uxudz diteneɬ.</em></span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n61">Chapman glosses his version of <em> xogho niɬggisr </em> as a unit, 'to each of them'.</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n62">Kari has <em> nigiyatathtonh.</em></span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n63">Kari has <em> xuyeyighiɬts'ok.</em></span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n64">Kari has <em> ntthidathtrit.</em></span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n65">Kari has <em> tthetixune'onh.</em></span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n66">Chapman's free translation</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n67">Kari has <em> xuyiɬ eyiggi zro </em> based on Chapman's <em> qŏyĭɬ-ĕyûkû-zro </em> 'all at once'.</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n68"><em> q'idz zro: </em> 'close to' is Chapman's gloss; <em> ntathdlingh: </em> 'rippling' is also Chapman's gloss</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n69">Chapman: <em> Ñitdodzu tĕ-dĭdĭdjĭˊɬ yûqho\'tzû.</em></span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n70">Chapman's free translation: 'that's the end of us'</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n71">Kari has yit dighelo.</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n72">Kari has <em> xitr'athdlo.</em></span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n73">Chapman glosses his version of <em> xuquxine'ots 'they went through'.</em></span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n74">Kari/Chapman have <em> xunaxdi </em> instead of <em> imk'i.</em></span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n75">Kari has <em> ngin </em> and Chapman <em> nin </em> as the second word of the sentence. Their gloss is 'it was'.</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n76">Chapman glosses <em> at </em> 'that one'.</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n77">Chapman/Kari's sentence ends in <em> ine' 'but, however'.</em></span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n78">Chapman has <em> Tsan </em> 'so' <em> in </em> 'that's it' as an independent sentence, 'so that's that'. </span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n79">Kari/Chapman have <em> ine' </em> 'however' instead of ED's <em> ngine' 'upriver'.</em></span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n80">Chapman has <em> qai-yâˊkâ-qûnnaiˊq, </em> suggesting <em> xiyoqo xinayh, </em> but the translation given is 'he called to them' rather than 'they called to him', which must be <em> xoqo xinayh.</em></span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n81">In place of Kari's <em> dinitht'uq, </em> Chapman has <em> dĭgĭcûkaiˊq </em> 'he caught with one hand'.</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n82">Chapman gives this personal name as <em> Ennagozragu </em> (interpreted by Kari as <em> Inigozrag). </em> ED hadn't heard the name before.</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n83">The first word of Chapman's sentence is <em> qaiyûˊkû-k'oˊdzû </em> 'immediately'.  Chapman's free translation is: 'at the same moment he sprung off.'</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n84">Chapman has <em> qaiyattoĭltlĭˊdzû </em> 'they will cook him'.</span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n85">Chapman has <em> qaiyûvwâçtrĭˊt </em> 'they pulled off the skin'. Kari has <em> tthe'itlch'iɬ.</em></span></li><li><span class="footnote" id="n86">Chapman's free translation is:  'Everything, grass and everything else was lost.'</span></li></ol>
</div>
</div>
</body>
